octopkg-tui is a terminal user interface (TUI) for pkg(8), the FreeBSD package
manager. It is the terminal counterpart of OctoPkg, with the same tabs and
keyboard shortcuts wherever the terminal allows them.

Version 0.1.0 is read-only: it lists installed packages and packages from the
configured repositories, with OctoPkg's package states, search, sorting, package
details, file lists, command output and help. It reads pkg query, pkg rquery and
pkg upgrade -n directly, without a shell, and runs as an unprivileged user.

WWW: https://github.com/cleberalves40/octopkg-tui
